<codeline lineno="51"><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;;<sp/><sp/><sp/>(not<sp/>a<sp/>single<sp/>section,<sp/>cuz<sp/>you<sp/>need<sp/>to<sp/>include<sp/>the<sp/>case<sp/>of<sp/>sections<sp/>depending<sp/>on<sp/>other<sp/>sections,<sp/>which<sp/>form<sp/>a<sp/>section<sp/>caller/callee<sp/>graph)<sp/>\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
